{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj47ebDE3m1q2ThhpYEv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a plain wooden door, ancient and weathered, grain swirling like frozen rivers beneath peeling varnish.*\n\n*The keyhole glows faintly.*\n\n*A click. A groan of old hinges. I swing inward, slowly, revealing—*\n\nA corridor of warm amber light. The smell of old books and rain-soaked stone. Somewhere distant, the sound of a single bell tolling.\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Will you pass through?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":114,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}